    <!-- Provider: Guild Wars 2 -->
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_GW2_Help">Guild Wars 2 achievements are read from ArenaNet's official API, which needs a free API key tied to your Guild Wars 2 account:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_GW2_SetupStep2">2. Create a new key and tick progression. That is the only permission this plugin needs, and a key limited to it cannot read your wallet, inventory or trading post history.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_GW2_SetupStep3">3. Copy the key into the box below, then click Check.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_GW2_NoDatesNote">Guild Wars 2 does not record when an achievement was earned and publishes no completion rates, so Guild Wars 2 achievements show no unlock date and no rarity.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_GW2_ApiKey_Help">このキーは、プラグインの設定画面に読み取り可能な形式で保存され、api.guildwars2.com へのみ送信されます。このキーは読み取り専用であり、作成したページからいつでも削除することができます。</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_GW2_MissingProgression">The key is valid but lacks the progression permission. Create a new key with progression ticked.</sys:String>

